# Form Components and Validation

## Form Architecture
- **ConfigurableForm**: Primary form architecture using [ConfigurableForm.tsx](mdc:components/form/ConfigurableForm.tsx)
- **Form Configurations**: [lib/config/forms/](mdc:lib/config/forms) - declarative form definitions
- **Legacy Forms**: [CorporateForm.tsx](mdc:components/CorporateForm.tsx) and [ParticipantForm.tsx](mdc:components/ParticipantForm.tsx) (deprecated)
- **Form Fields**: Atomic components in [components/form/fields/](mdc:components/form/fields) directory
- **Composite Components**: Complex form sections in [components/form/composite/](mdc:components/form/composite)
- **Validation**: Schema-based validation in [lib/validation/schemas/](mdc:lib/validation/schemas)

## Form Components Guidelines
- **Prefer ConfigurableForm**: Use configuration-driven approach over monolithic components
- All forms use React Hook Form with Zod validation
- **Three-Layer Architecture**: UI components → Form fields → Application components  
- **Network-Aware Components**: Forms automatically handle Stellar network selection
- **Auto-Loading**: Account data loads automatically when valid account ID is entered
- Form fields are atomic components in [components/form/fields/](mdc:components/form/fields)
- File upload functionality is handled by [FileUploadField.tsx](mdc:components/form/FileUploadField.tsx)
- Tag selection is handled by [TagSelector.tsx](mdc:components/form/TagSelector.tsx)

## Network Integration
- **NetworkAwareStellarAccount**: Combines network selection with account input and auto-loading
- **Network Switching**: Forms automatically clear and reload data when network changes
- **Sequence Number Safety**: Transactions use correct sequence numbers from target network

## Validation Rules
- Use Zod schemas defined in [lib/validation.ts](mdc:lib/validation.ts)
- Validation schemas should be exported and reused across forms and API routes
- Error messages should be user-friendly and in appropriate language based on context

## Form State Management
- Use React Hook Form for form state
- Handle loading states during submission
- Implement proper error handling and user feedback
- Reset forms after successful submission

## File Upload Integration
- File uploads are processed via [api/upload/route.ts](mdc:app/api/upload/route.ts)
- Upload utility functions are in [lib/upload.ts](mdc:lib/upload.ts)
- Handle file validation, size limits, and type restrictions